                        "sense_id": "1826daa4-193f-3883-b5e6-15238b7a8dfd",
                        "entry_id": "dc7195cd-b564-38a4-9996-34b013bbab91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "niet in de werkelijkheid bestaand"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "28a4054e-3569-3ed5-88d0-abb78a8a2477",
                        "entry_id": "dc7195cd-b564-38a4-9996-34b013bbab91",
                        "glosses": [
                            "alsof het niet echt is, maar het juist wel is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f23b5892-206d-447b-882d-12636a9d79de",
                                "sense_id": "28a4054e-3569-3ed5-88d0-abb78a8a2477",
                                "text": "‘Guy belde toen we donderdag op het terras zaten’, vertellen Pierre en Yvonne Frederix, Elke Vanbockrijcks schoonouders, die in Bilzen wonen. ‘Ik nam nog vrolijk de telefoon op, maar hij zei: “Ik heb geen goed nieuws. Elke is omvergereden.” Het was een onwezenlijk telefoontje.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b26648e1-1c6e-4952-87ac-a5c0ca06efce",
                                "sense_id": "28a4054e-3569-3ed5-88d0-abb78a8a2477",
                                "text": "Toon: ,,En daar stond ik. Rechts van mij waren ze het leven van onze dochter aan het redden, links van mij lag mijn vrouw op de grond. Totaal onwezenlijk. Ik voelde me zo machteloos dat ik toen in gedachten de twee engelbewaarders van onze dochters, die ook op hun geboortekaartje staan, heb aangesproken: hun oma en een goeie vriend die 18 jaar geleden nota bene aan een hartkwaal is gestorven. 'Laat Maartje het redden...'\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "680388a8-33c4-4d40-99c8-19c39f778858",
                        "source_entry_id": "dc7195cd-b564-38a4-9996-34b013bbab91",
                        "source_sense_id": "1826daa4-193f-3883-b5e6-15238b7a8dfd",
                        "source_sense_description": "niet in de werkelijkheid bestaand",
                        "target_lang_word": "unreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unreal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not real or substantial; having no actual presence in reality; lacking the characteristics of reality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c25e040-060b-4d76-b39a-70323de3bce0",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "The word ‘ivory’ rang in the air, was whispered, was sighed. You would think they were praying to it. A taint of imbecile rapacity blew through it all, like a whiff from some corpse. By Jove! I’ve never seen anything so unreal in my life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a504765b-7056-47bb-8078-c4920a39728e",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "\"The Boy's Uncle made me Real,\" he said. \"That was a great many years ago; but once you are Real you can't become unreal again. It lasts for always.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "very impressive; amazing; unbelievable; incredible; larger or more fantastic than typical of real life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6674e99-12ea-46c7-bbea-0e9e99150479",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "The video includes unreal footage of an eight-metre wave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ca76c9d-177e-40dc-8e60-642f1dd41259",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "I just had an unreal hamburger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf692e34-d7a1-4971-a9b2-3e68e3ebc514",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He stops his cab at every traffic light, unrolls his window and calls out to the other drivers: \"I've got a movie star in the car! Follow me down to see her come out. She is unreal, man! I am in seventh heaven! I have a dream!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94e9e63e-3181-4536-9177-cab462300051",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "\"She just set me up\" \"Now that's unreal, man. I mean, we're talking about a fairly considerable sum here, aren't we, Dexter?\" \"Listen to me. She set me up, with a dude she was cheatin' on me with"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2004dd9-f4a8-4715-8b9d-e3703f1e0ecc",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "“Yeah, she does have a certain mental toughness that is unreal,” agreed Berto. “I really don't think of her as a girl, I mean, it's like she's a tough buddy or tough sister to me.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b580f5c5-8b2b-4b88-8330-b331125c646d",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He walks around and tries to pluck a flower on the ground. david exclaims, “Holy shit, this is unreal! i can feel the flower, the heat from the sun, and i can even hear the wind! The smells are so vibrant! How could i possibly be smelling flowers?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
